---
import ServicePage from '../layouts/ServicePage.astro';

const description = "Modern, research-based ear wax removal at DUET combines precision visualization technology, evidence-based care, and patient-centered treatment to safely evaluate and manage cerumen buildup while protecting long-term hearing health.";

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'MedicalProcedure',
  name: 'Ear Wax Removal',
  procedureType: 'NoninvasiveProcedure',
  description,
  url: 'https://duethearing.com/ear-wax-removal/',
};
---
<ServicePage
  pageTitle="Ear Wax Removal | Duet Hearing"
  description={description}
  parentLabel="Hearing &amp; Tinnitus"
  currentLabel="Ear Wax Removal"
  pageHeading="Ear Wax Removal"
  sidebarImage="/s9-card-1.jpg"
  schema={schema}
>

  <p class="service-intro">Modern, Research-Based Ear Wax Removal</p>

  <section class="service-block">
    <p>At DUET, ear wax removal is approached as part of comprehensive ear and auditory system health, not simply a routine procedure. Our biology-forward clinic model combines precision visualization technology, evidence-based care, and patient-centered treatment to safely evaluate and manage cerumen (ear wax) buildup while protecting long-term hearing health.</p>
    <p>Ear wax, also known as cerumen, plays an important protective role in the ear canal. However, excessive buildup can interfere with hearing, comfort, communication, hearing device performance, and overall auditory function.</p>
    <p>Common symptoms of impacted ear wax may include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Muffled hearing</li>
      <li>Ear fullness or pressure</li>
      <li>Tinnitus or ringing in the ears</li>
      <li>Itching or irritation</li>
      <li>Dizziness or imbalance sensations</li>
      <li>Hearing aid feedback or malfunction</li>
      <li>Ear discomfort</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block">
    <h2>DUET's Approach to Ear Wax Removal</h2>
    <p>DUET utilizes advanced visualization and modern clinical techniques to safely assess and remove impacted cerumen with comfort and precision.</p>
    <p>Our ear health evaluations may include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Microscopic or video otoscopy examination</li>
      <li>Comprehensive ear canal assessment</li>
      <li>Hearing screening when appropriate</li>
      <li>Hearing aid and earbud evaluation</li>
      <li>Preventive ear health education</li>
      <li>Personalized recommendations for long-term ear care</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We focus on minimizing trauma to the ear canal while improving hearing clarity, comfort, and device performance.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block">
    <h2>Technology-Enabled Ear Care</h2>
    <p>Our clinic programs are designed around a research-informed, minimally invasive philosophy of care. Depending on the patient's needs, ear wax management may involve:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Precision instrumentation</li>
      <li>Microsuction techniques</li>
      <li>Gentle irrigation</li>
      <li>Real-time magnified visualization</li>
      <li>Ongoing monitoring for recurrent buildup</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Every treatment plan is individualized based on ear anatomy, hearing status, medical history, and patient comfort.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block">
    <h2>Specialized Care for Hearing Device Users</h2>
    <p>Patients who wear hearing aids, earbuds, custom hearing protection, or in-ear monitors may be more prone to wax accumulation. Excess cerumen can affect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Hearing aid sound quality</li>
      <li>Device performance</li>
      <li>Feedback and distortion</li>
      <li>Ear canal ventilation</li>
      <li>Listening clarity</li>
    </ul>
    <p>DUET provides specialized ear care programs designed to support optimal hearing technology performance and long-term ear health.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block">
    <h2>Why Patients Choose DUET for Ear Wax Removal</h2>
    <p>Patients choose DUET because we combine:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Advanced ear visualization technology</li>
      <li>Research-based clinical protocols</li>
      <li>Precision, patient-centered care</li>
      <li>Comfortable, minimally invasive techniques</li>
      <li>Expertise in hearing and auditory system health</li>
      <li>A modern, biology-forward approach to audiology</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Our goal is not only to remove ear wax safely, but to improve hearing clarity, ear comfort, and overall auditory wellness.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block">
    <h2>Schedule an Ear Wax Removal Evaluation</h2>
    <p>If you are experiencing blocked ears, muffled hearing, tinnitus, or discomfort, DUET offers comprehensive ear health evaluations and safe professional ear wax removal.</p>
    <p>Experience a modern approach to ear care grounded in innovation, precision, and evidence-based audiology.</p>
  </section>

</ServicePage>
